<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: GUIDE - CZECH HOLIDAYS IN 1997.</title>
<headline>GUIDE - CZECH HOLIDAYS IN 1997.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are Czech market and office</p>
<p>holidays in 1997:</p>
<p>(Markets/offices closed on each occasion)</p>
<p>January	  1    Wed	 New Year's Day</p>
<p>February	 none</p>
<p>March	    31   Mon	 Easter Monday</p>
<p>April	    none</p>
<p>May		1    Thurs     May Day</p>
<p>		   8    Thurs     Liberation Day</p>
<p>June	     none</p>
<p>July	     5    Sat	 Saints Cyril &amp; Methodius Festival</p>
<p>		   6    Sun	 Jan Hus Day</p>
<p>August	   none</p>
<p>September	none</p>
<p>October	  28   Tues	National Day</p>
<p>November	 none</p>
<p>December	 24   Wed	 Christmas Eve,</p>
<p>		   25   Thurs     Christmas Day</p>
<p>		   26   Fri	 St Stephens Day</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
